I'm a final-year M.Sc. student in machine learning at Aalto University and a research
assistant there, writing two first-author papers on forecasting and model evaluation. I
write about machine learning and statistics, worked out from first principles and built
up from running code.

I built [Taliesin](projects/taliesin/index.tmd), the Rust tool this site is made with,
using AI coding tools.

